Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.27,0:01:34.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.35,0:01:37.21,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你不知道吗？那个外国人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.56,0:01:38.22,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}外国人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.72,0:01:43.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她上周才转学到二年级 A 班来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.60,0:01:45.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}很漂亮吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.63,0:01:49.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她叫惣流·明日香·兰利
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.57,0:01:50.23,special,,0000,0000,0000,,{\move(45,-427.5,562.5,450)\frz18}大减价\N一张30元
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.57,0:01:50.23,special,,0000,0000,0000,,{\move(596.25,-517.5,1192.5,247.5)\frz15}明日香第一手照片申购书
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.86,0:01:52.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是太可爱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.33,0:01:54.57,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}从国外回来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.19,0:01:56.89,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是不是有点太前卫了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.16,0:02:00.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}别乱说，她肯定在德国经历了伤心的离别
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.93,0:02:03.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怀着破碎的心，生活在这陌生的土地上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.14,0:02:15.03,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}每个人都明日香、明日香的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.31,0:02:16.74,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大家都无忧无虑的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.80,0:02:17.47,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.60,0:02:22.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}从照片上是看不出她的那种性格的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.92,0:02:25.92,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}Hello ，真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.82,0:02:28.02,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}Guten Morgen
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.82,0:02:30.41,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,100)}*这里明日香与真嗣的对话是德文 “早上好”的意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.43,0:02:30.41,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}Guu…Guuten morugen
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.45,0:02:33.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又来了！一大早就愁眉苦脸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.43,0:02:35.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是本小姐在和你打招呼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.65,0:02:37.99,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}给个高兴点的表情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.81,0:02:40.92,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对了，在这里吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.15,0:02:41.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}另一位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.20,0:02:42.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你白痴啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}当然是第一适格者啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，绫波的话…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.93,0:02:59.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}Hello
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.21,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你就是绫波丽吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.63,0:03:03.82,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}原型机的驾驶员
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.58,0:03:07.51,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我叫明日香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.93,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}惣流·明日香·兰利
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.49,0:03:10.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 二号机的驾驶员
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.39,0:03:12.17,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好好相处吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.27,0:03:13.73,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.30,0:03:17.27,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这样各方面都会比较方便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是命令的话我就照做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:20.24,0:03:21.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是奇怪的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.62,0:03:25.77,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 的驾驶员该不会都是从怪人中挑选的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.77,0:03:36.86,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你有点瘦了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.18,0:03:37.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.35,0:03:39.73,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是因为你坠入了一段可悲的苦恋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.25,0:03:43.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么你知道这些事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.55,0:03:48.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那是因为眼角上有痣的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.97,0:03:51.08,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}命中注定一生要不断流泪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.66,0:03:53.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}接下来你打算求爱吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.08,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过不行哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.72,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有位可怕的大姐在外面看着呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.95,0:04:02.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好久不见了，加持
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.93,0:04:03.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯，有一阵子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.45,0:04:06.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过没想到你会这么粗心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.48,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他的蠢样一点没变
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.02,0:04:13.38,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}二号机移交完毕的话，你就快点回去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:13.90,0:04:17.08,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}今天早上来了调职的命令，要我一直待在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又可以三人一起工作了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就像以前一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谁要跟你这种人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.30,0:04:24.79,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}敌袭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.15,0:04:28.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}防空管制群　警戒级别调整至 A 级
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.26,0:04:31.94,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}航空侦察队自百里起飞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.29,0:04:35.10,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}厚木第 3 航空队 以及 哨戒机 2 机，出发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.60,0:04:36.52,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}紧急赶赴现场
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.75,0:04:27.91,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}警戒中的巡洋舰『榛名』来电
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.47,0:04:31.23,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我方在纪伊半岛外海发现巨大潜航物体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.52,0:04:32.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开始发送资料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.28,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对照接收到的资料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.91,0:04:35.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}波长分析图样为蓝色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.01,0:04:36.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}确定是使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}全员第一战斗位置
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.69,0:04:45.93,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}由于上次的战斗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:46.21,0:04:49.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第 3 新东京市的防御系统受到了很大的损伤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.82,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}到目前，修复率是 26%
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.30,0:04:55.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而实战时的可运转率可以说是零
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.80,0:05:01.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因此，这次要在目标露出水面登岸之际一举击破
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.21,0:05:05.93,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}初号机和二号机要交替对目标进行波状攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.21,0:05:07.27,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}进行近距离作战
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.67,0:05:08.32,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.84,0:05:11.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在日本的首次战斗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.03,0:05:14.48,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么不能交给我一个人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没办法呀，这是战术嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.22,0:05:22.49,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}先说在前面，你可别给我拖后腿啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么那种人会被选来当驾驶员啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.10,0:05:43.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}二打一真是窝囊，一点也不喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.54,0:05:46.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们没有选择的余地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.40,0:05:48.77,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是为了生存下去的手段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.81,0:05:53.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.98,0:06:00.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}攻击开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那我先来，你掩护我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.34,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}掩、掩护
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.40,0:06:06.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}女士优先啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.41,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}切！明明是新来的，还摆架子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.09,0:06:15.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}能行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.72,0:06:30.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.61,0:06:34.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么样？第三适格者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.85,0:06:38.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}战斗就是要简洁又优美才行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.82,0:06:52.08,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}太耍赖了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.57,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}本日上午 10 点 58 分 15 秒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.20,0:07:04.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}受到分为二体后的目标甲攻击的初号机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.68,0:07:07.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}于骏河湾外 2 公里海域处沉没
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.86,0:07:11.67,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}58 分 20 秒，二号机因为目标乙的攻击而停止活动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.29,0:07:14.97,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}针对上述状况， E 计划负责人的评价是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真难看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.61,0:07:18.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}都是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.79,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}害我难得的首战泡汤了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.92,0:07:21.97,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你说的什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.08,0:07:24.58,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}都是因为惣流你做了傻事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.84,0:07:28.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}傻事?! 你这废物怎么敢这样说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.38,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要脸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.58,0:07:33.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么呀！你自己急着要打倒它才出这种乱子的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.25,0:07:36.38,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那是什么啊！像萝卜一样插在海上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你自己也那副德性还说别人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.77,0:07:38.36,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,100)}上午 11 点 03 分左右，NERV 放弃作战
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.78,0:07:42.05,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,100)}将指挥权移交联合国第 2 方面军
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是的！脸都丢光了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.43,0:07:48.48,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}11 点 05 分，用 N  地雷对目标进行了攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.43,0:07:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,100)}{\pos(661.5,983.25)}{\fs40.5}2
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.71,0:07:52.12,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又要重新绘制地图了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.71,0:07:55.41,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}成功融化敌方 28% 的构成物质
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.48,0:07:56.01,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}成功了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.12,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只能稍微拖延一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.27,0:07:59.02,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}再度进攻只是时间上的问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.72,0:08:03.21,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}算了，能争取到重新决策的时间也算是赚到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.61,0:08:04.74,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们两个听好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.61,0:08:07.61,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们知道自己的工作是什么吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.27,0:08:09.17,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}驾驶 EVA
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.04,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不！是战胜使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.63,0:08:15.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们 NERV 不是为了出这种洋相而存在的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因此需要你们互相合作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.34,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么要和这种人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.86,0:08:20.52,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.80,0:08:25.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么大家都那么爱生气啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.03,0:08:28.01,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大人都是爱面子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个…美里小姐呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.18,0:08:31.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在做善后处理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.33,0:08:34.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}负责人就是为了负责任而存在的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.71,0:08:39.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}从相关各部门来的抗议书和受害报告书
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.97,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还有，这是从联合国来的帐单
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.27,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}以及从宣传部来的抱怨哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.58,0:08:46.67,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你慢慢看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.37,0:08:49.28,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不用看也知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.76,0:08:52.13,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}“要打就到自己地盘上去打”之类的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是聪明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.71,0:08:54.79,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}用不着他们来说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.97,0:08:56.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要是在这里能打倒使徒的话我早就这么做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.65,0:08:59.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}使徒一定能由我来打倒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.35,0:09:01.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}副司令气得火冒三丈呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.48,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要是再来一次的话，肯定降你的职
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.33,0:09:09.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇司令不在这里真是不幸中的万幸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.93,0:09:11.21,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在的话你当场就被开除了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.63,0:09:13.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这些也不必看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.46,0:09:17.18,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那，你带来了能保住我饭碗的主意了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.61,0:09:18.57,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只有一个哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.03,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真不愧是赤木律子博士
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.48,0:09:24.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好心肠的老朋友真是不可或缺啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.26,0:09:27.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}遗憾的是，拯救老朋友危机的并不是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这主意是加持提出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.69,0:09:29.98,special,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,100)\pos(753.75,596.25)\frz27\fs31.5}My heart
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}加持的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.73,0:09:46.83,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.31,0:09:49.81,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}喊这么大声怎么也没人回
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这…这是什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.55,0:09:57.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真没礼貌！这些是我的行李
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.86,0:10:00.34,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为…为什么惣流会在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.09,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你才是！怎么还在啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.36,0:10:04.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.95,0:10:07.69,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}从今天起你被赶出去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.43,0:10:11.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里要和我一起住
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.55,0:10:14.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只要考虑一下谁更优秀的话，这样的选择也是理所当然的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.56,0:10:17.81,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}其实要是能和加持先生住在一起的话就更好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.15,0:10:21.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，为什么日本的房间这么小
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}连一半行李都放不下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.48,0:10:31.52,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而且为什么日本人都这么没有危机感啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.37,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}竟然能在这种没锁的房间里生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.93,0:10:35.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是无法相信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.81,0:10:38.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为日本人会体贴别人，为别人着想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.64,0:10:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,100)}{\pos(315,1012.5)}美里小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.64,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,100)}{\pos(1125,1012.5)}美里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们回来啦，进展很快嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.07,0:10:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,100)}{\pos(315,1012.5)}什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.07,0:10:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,100)}{\pos(1125,1012.5)}什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.74,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}本次的作战准备
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.18,0:10:47.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.27,0:10:51.02,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第 7 使徒的弱点只有一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.69,0:10:54.93,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对分离的两个核心同时给予重击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.40,0:10:56.13,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只有这个办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.48,0:11:01.88,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是说 EVA 两机的进攻时机要完全一致
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.27,0:11:05.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为此需要你们两人的互相协调，达到完美的相同步调
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.95,0:11:10.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所～以～说，现在开始你们两个要住在一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.15,0:11:16.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不要！俗话说男女七岁后不可同住
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.01,0:11:19.02,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}使徒目前正在进行自我修复
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.40,0:11:21.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第 2 波攻击就在 6 天后，已经没有时间了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.53,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这也太胡来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.73,0:11:27.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这里有一个让胡来变成可能的方法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.71,0:11:30.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为了达到两人的完美协调
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.53,0:11:32.94,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们得把跟这首曲子配合的攻击模式记下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.46,0:11:34.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要在 6天内完成
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:34.62,0:11:35.64,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}1 秒钟也不能拖延
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.28,0:11:49.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过真嗣那家伙到底怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.09,0:11:51.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}已经 3 天没来学校了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}咦？这不是班长么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.41,0:11:58.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}笨蛋三人组里的两个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.04,0:12:00.73,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么班长会在这里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.41,0:12:02.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我来探望惣流同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那你们来这里做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.69,0:12:06.04,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们来探望碇同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.00,0:12:08.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么你们也停在这里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.02,0:12:19.22,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你…你这叛徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.49,0:12:21.41,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}竟然还穿着情侣装
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好恶心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.24,0:12:27.91,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这…这是因为“日本人都是从外表开始深入的”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里小姐这么强迫我们穿的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.66,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真…真不检点！你们两个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.51,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}误…误会啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.70,0:12:36.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}根本不是什么误会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.55,0:12:37.33,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，欢迎光临
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.26,0:12:41.51,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这到底是怎么回事，请说明一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.69,0:12:46.67,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}原来是这样啊，早点说不就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.93,0:12:49.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}协调感练习得如何了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这个嘛…就如你们所见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.18,0:12:57.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那是当然的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.58,0:13:01.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要我降低到真嗣的水准怎么可能顺利嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.41,0:13:03.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早就说过这是在胡来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.84,0:13:04.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那，你不想干了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.34,0:13:07.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但没有其他的人选了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.46,0:13:09.83,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}丽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.40,0:13:10.59,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.96,0:13:11.61,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你去试试看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.18,0:13:12.34,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.40,0:13:27.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}看来变更作战计划，让丽来组合会比较好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.26,0:13:35.53,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌！我不干了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.15,0:13:40.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明日香同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.14,0:13:41.73,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这种刁蛮的女生也会流泪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.36,0:13:45.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇～同～学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.73,0:13:48.58,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}快追啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.94,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你让女孩子哭了哦！负起责任来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.89,0:14:02.27,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.27,0:14:03.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么也别说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.42,0:14:09.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我很明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我只有驾驶 EVA 这条路可走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.03,0:14:16.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我会去做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.01,0:14:21.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}事到如今，无论如何我都要对丽和美里还以颜色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.89,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还以颜色？没那么严重吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.12,0:14:27.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}说什么呀！亏你还是个男孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.93,0:14:33.64,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自尊心受到的伤害，我会以十倍奉还的
