Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.57,0:14:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(720,967.5)\1c&H2020a0\bord0\fn迷你简硬笔行书\fs112.5}还\N有\N2\N天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.00,0:14:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(720,967.5)\1c&H2020a0\bord0\fn迷你简硬笔行书\fs112.5}有\N2\N天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.24,0:15:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(1012.5,607.5)\1c&H000000\bord0\fn迷你简硬笔行书\fs123.75}明天\N　进行\N　　攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.73,0:15:15.39,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.60,0:15:16.33,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还在工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.78,0:15:19.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}刚才打电话说今晚会通宵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.85,0:15:22.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那，今晚就只有我们两个人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.42,0:15:38.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是不破的耶利哥之墙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.42,0:15:42.33,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,100)}*“耶利哥之墙”依旧约圣经中的记载，是以坚强要塞著称的有名城壁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.19,0:15:42.33,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}越雷池半步就要处死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.94,0:15:45.03,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}小孩子不要熬夜，快点睡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.15,0:15:49.74,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么日本人能躺在地板上睡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:50.13,0:15:50.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是无法相信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.78,0:16:59.88,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.01,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明明自己也还是个孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.88,0:17:18.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要啦，有人看着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.31,0:17:19.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:19.03,0:17:19.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你还问谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.51,0:17:44.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我已经和你没有任何关系了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.18,0:17:46.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}能不能不要再做这种事情了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.75,0:17:49.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，你的嘴唇并没有阻止我哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.57,0:17:53.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你的嘴唇和你说的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:54.24,0:17:55.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我该相信哪边呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.37,0:18:20.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.84,0:18:22.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}今天真稀奇，你竟然没喝酒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.70,0:18:24.78,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有点事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.84,0:18:25.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是男人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.26,0:18:28.92,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}都有啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.26,0:18:31.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是喜欢的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要乱说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.80,0:18:37.83,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谁会跟那种人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.27,0:18:41.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哎，就算是少不经世
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.23,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但竟然跟那种人交往…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.66,0:18:45.47,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是我人生的最大污点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:46.14,0:18:48.17,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是指加持啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.72,0:18:49.66,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你又让他动摇了么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我说你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.24,0:18:53.02,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}生气就说明被我说中了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.14,0:18:56.03,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这次你就坦白一点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.76,0:18:58.48,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他已经和 8 年前不同了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.04,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他一点都没变
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.19,0:19:02.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是不成熟…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.90,0:19:06.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好了，工作、工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:06.75,0:19:08.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明天就要决战了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.72,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}目标突破强罗绝对防卫线
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.72,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,100)}*强罗是地名，因是第3新东京市最后一道防线被称“强罗绝对防卫线”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.76,0:19:23.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}来了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.59,0:19:26.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这次不会再让你跑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.60,0:19:29.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}音乐开始的同时展开 A.T.Field
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.67,0:19:30.86,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}之后就照计划进行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.21,0:19:32.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们都明白了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.15,0:19:33.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}目标侵入山区村落
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}听好，一开始就开足马力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}全力以赴速战速决
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.60,0:19:41.32,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.89,0:19:43.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在 62 秒内解决掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.62,0:19:45.71,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}目标到达零地点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.38,0:19:46.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}外部电源
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.03,0:19:47.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}脱离
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:50.04,0:19:50.38,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}发射
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.87,0:21:04.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 两机　确认
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.86,0:21:10.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真难看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:15.66,0:21:18.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}喂！你怎么对我的二号机这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.88,0:21:22.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哪有！是你先绊倒我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:22.00,0:21:23.19,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}最后没把握好时机的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.40,0:21:24.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.73,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}都是因为你平常老是在发呆才会这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.88,0:21:29.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}昨晚也是那样，不好好睡觉在做什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:30.26,0:21:32.88,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我…我在为了今天的战斗做冥想训练啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:32.88,0:21:36.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}骗人！你明明是想趁我睡着时偷吻我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.94,0:21:39.03,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好狡猾！你竟然醒着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.05,0:21:42.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}太过分了！我本来只是随口说说的，居然是真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:42.46,0:21:43.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你吻了我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:44.20,0:21:46.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没…没有啊，中途就停止了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.31,0:21:48.49,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}色鬼！色狼！变态！真叫人不敢相信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:48.85,0:21:53.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你、你才是…睡觉时说梦话，睡相又差
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.73,0:21:56.92,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又在给我丢脸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:06.54,0:23:08.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}即将孵化的使徒沉睡在浅间山火山口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:09.34,0:23:11.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}NERV 将首次试图生擒使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:11.74,0:23:14.81,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}穿上特殊装备的二号机要挑战熔岩和高温高压
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.36,0:23:16.94,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}下集　岩浆潜水员
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:17.55,0:23:19.43,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,100)}下集也有服务哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.09,0:00:13.95,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就像是残酷天使一样　少年啊　成为神话吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.09,0:00:13.95,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}残酷な天使のように　少年よ神話になれ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.88,0:00:29.40,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}即使苍蓝的风于此刻　敲打着内心里的门扉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.88,0:00:29.40,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}蒼い風がいま　胸のドアを叩いても
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.59,0:00:37.13,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也会一味地注视着我并对我微笑的你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.59,0:00:37.13,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}私だけをただ見つめて微笑んでるあなた
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.81,0:00:44.40,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}轻轻碰触的事物　对于渴望的事物感到着迷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.81,0:00:44.40,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そっとふれるもの　もとめることに夢中で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.64,0:00:51.08,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}甚至依然尚未知道命运的　你那令人怜爱的双眸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.64,0:00:51.08,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}運命さえまだ知らない　いたいけな瞳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.16,0:00:58.13,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是总有一天我们将会察觉到　那道背影里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.16,0:00:58.13,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}だけどいつか気付くでしょう　その背中には
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:59.68,0:01:06.14,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}存在着以遥远未来为目标的翅膀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:59.68,0:01:06.14,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}遥か未来めざすための羽根があること
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.18,0:01:14.60,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}残酷天使的命题　终于从窗边起飞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.18,0:01:14.60,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}残酷な天使のテーゼ　窓辺からやがて飛び立つ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.60,0:01:21.95,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果要以溅出的热情　背叛回忆的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.60,0:01:21.95,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ほとばしる熱いパトスで　思い出を裏切るなら
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.08,0:01:25.69,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么便怀抱这片宇宙（天空）并闪闪发光吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.08,0:01:25.69,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}この宇宙（そら）を抱いて輝く
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.85,0:01:29.48,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}少年啊　成为神话吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.85,0:01:29.48,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}少年よ神話になれ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.35,0:22:03.10,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}带我飞向月球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.35,0:22:03.10,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}Fly me to the moon
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.22,0:22:07.81,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}并让我在群星之间嬉戏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.22,0:22:07.81,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}And let me play among the stars
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:08.81,0:22:11.94,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}让我看看春天像什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:08.81,0:22:11.94,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}Let me see what Spring is like
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.07,0:22:15.44,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在木星和火星上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.07,0:22:15.44,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}On Jupiter and Mars
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:16.24,0:22:23.16,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}换句话说，请握住我的手!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:16.24,0:22:23.16,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}In other words, hold my hand!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.45,0:22:31.21,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}换句话说，亲爱的，请吻我!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.45,0:22:31.21,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}In other words, darling, kiss me!
